---
// About section (PRD §5.6). Sits directly under the hero on the single page.
// All copy is owner-supplied and used verbatim. The timeline and "How I work"
// block were cut in increment 6, not deferred.
---

<section class="about shell" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <h2 id="about-heading" class="heading">About</h2>

  <div class="intro">
    {/* No photo yet. Visibly marked placeholder per CLAUDE.md §7. */}
    <div class="photo" role="img" aria-label="Photo placeholder">
      <span class="meta">[TODO: photo]</span>
    </div>

    <div class="text">
      <p class="story">
        CSE (Data Science) student at VJIT, started 2025. I build things end to
        end &mdash; plan the architecture, make the calls, and use AI tools like
        Claude Code to implement fast. KalaCart, an artisan marketplace built for
        Smart India Hackathon 2026, is the first thing I've shipped that had to
        survive contact with a real deadline and a real ministry review.
      </p>

      {/* Plain text: there is no Community page to link to (PRD §5.7). */}
      <p class="meta community">
        Production team member, GDG on Campus VJIT &mdash; social media and video
        editing for the club's channels.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* No top rule: the hero subject fades out into this section, and a hairline
     right under the fade would read as a cut. */
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--rhythm);
  }

  .heading {
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    font-size: var(--size-h2);
  }

  .intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .intro {
      grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .photo {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    /* Capped so a full-width 3:4 box does not dominate a phone screen. */
    max-width: 240px;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    background-color: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-content: start;
  }

  .story {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.375rem);
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .community {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
</style>
